#. module: hr_employee_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_employee_transfer.field_employee_transfer__state
msgid ""
"New: Transfer is created and not confirmed.\n"
"        Transferred: Transfer is confirmed. Transfer stays in this status till\n"
"         the transferred Branch receive the employee.\n"
"        Done: Employee is Joined/Received in the transferred Branch.\n"
"        Cancelled: Transfer is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Nueva: la transferencia se creó y no está confirmada.\n"
"        Transferida: la transferencia está confirmada y permanece en este estado hasta que\n"
"         la sucursal de destino reciba al empleado.\n"
"        Completada: el empleado se incorporó o fue recibido en la sucursal de destino.\n"
"        Cancelada: la transferencia está cancelada."

